Error [jet.UnknownField]: The reflected layout has no field `missing`
  --> tests/ui/layout_unknown_selector.jet:7:13
    |
  7 |             missing: info[.missing]
    |             ^^^^^^^
 Why: Typed selectors must name a field declared by the reflected type
 Fix: Use one of the names in `T.reflect().fields`
